---
config:
  theme: base
  look: classic
  themeVariables:
    background: "#FFFFFF"
    mainBkg: "#FFFFFF"
    primaryColor: "#EAF2FF"
    primaryBorderColor: "#2563EB"
    primaryTextColor: "#172033"
    secondaryColor: "#ECFDF5"
    tertiaryColor: "#FFF7ED"
    lineColor: "#475569"
    textColor: "#172033"
---
flowchart TD
    start([新一轮 engine step]) --> delta[计算每个请求的待处理 token 数<br/><i>num_tokens_with_spec − num_computed</i>]
    delta --> limits[按 token 预算 / 模型长度 / 编码器预算<br/>和长 prefill 阈值裁剪]
    limits --> slots{分配槽位成功?<br/><i>allocate_slots</i>}
    slots -->|否| preempt[抢占并重置已计算数 / KV<br/>或停止本轮选择]
    preempt --> result
    slots -->|是| result[构造调度输出<br/><i>SchedulerOutput</i>]
    result --> advance[推进已计算数<br/><i>_update_after_schedule</i>]
    advance --> execute[执行前向 / 采样]
    execute --> settle[结算本轮输出<br/><i>update_from_output</i>]
    settle --> status{请求结束?}
    status -->|否| start
    status -->|是| free[释放请求引用；缓存块可继续留存]
    free --> start

    classDef decision fill:#FFF7ED,stroke:#C2410C,color:#172033
    classDef state fill:#ECFDF5,stroke:#059669,color:#172033
    class slots,status decision
    class result,advance,settle state
